# This repository holds a static website, not firmware.
#
# It was created from the ISC firmware repo template, whose .gitignore
# carried the usual C/embedded patterns. Those were removed: the kernel
# module rule `*.mod*` matched every `*.module.css` file in the Astro
# source tree, so eight stylesheets were silently excluded from the
# initial import and the build failed in CI with "could not resolve
# ../../styles/pages/competition.module.css". Other template patterns
# (`*.d`, `*.map`, `*.app`, `*.out`) are the same trap waiting to happen.
# Do not reintroduce them here.

# Node / web tooling (the site lives in code/)
node_modules/
dist/
.astro/
.vercel/
.netlify/

# Environment
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
